abstract: >-
  An experimental contract, contextual applicability evaluator, reference compiler,
  compiler-independent plan verifier, self-contained Phase A conformance bundle, black-box runner,
  and internally authored cross-language differential seed for compiling admitted enterprise
  organization facts and semantic changes into obligation-bound task plans.
